  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>15</span><font>2024.03</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>李强总理重磅报告：清醒看到挑战！全国将开辟新赛道、AI+行动启动、强化国家战略科技力量新机会来了！</h2> <b>2024.03.15</b> <h1 style=\"padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.6em; text-indent: 0em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; text-indent: 0em;\">3月5日，李强总理向十四届全国人大二次会议作政府工作报告，要点如下：</span><br/></h1><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 15px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;background-color: rgb(217, 33, 66);color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;font-size: 15px\"><strong style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible\">一、2023年工作回顾</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 15px\">国内生产总值增长5.2%</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 15px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 15px\">粮食产量1.39万亿斤</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.6em;text-indent: 0em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important\"><span style=\";padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-size: 15px\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 10